  <data name="Ble.Intro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hold Menu + Volume + on the remote (~5 to 10 s, right next to the PC): a new row should appear. The Siri Remote advertises the Apple manufacturer (0x004C) and its serial number as its name. Double-click the row (or “Pair”) to pair it without going through Windows Settings.</value></data>
